{"availability":"available","full":"OpenGalaxea/GalaxeaDP","name":"GalaxeaDP","description":"Galaxea's first diffusion policy release","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"Python","stars":41,"forks":3,"created":"2025-08-12T08:23:44Z","updated":"2025-08-18T12:24:20Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":null,"topics":[],"demo":"https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=ms-vscode.live-server","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T13:01:17.367Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-15T13:01:17.367Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-15T13:01:17.367Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T16:44:16.113Z","stars":41,"forks":3},{"at":"2026-10-13T04:13:00.327Z","stars":41,"forks":3},{"at":"2026-10-15T13:01:17.367Z","stars":41,"forks":3}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["GalaxeaDP is the open implementation of the diffusion policy algorithm, fully compatible with GalaxeaManipSim and GalaxeaLeRobot. It enables end-to-end simulation pipelines — from data generation to training, evaluation, and deployment in simulation — for the Galaxea R1 series (R1, R1 Pro, R1 Lite). ℹ️ Real-world datasets and end-effector controller for R1 Lite will be released later — stay tuned!"],"features":["🛠 Full Simulation Pipeline – From data collection in GalaxeaManipSim to training and simulation evaluation.","📦 One-Click Scripts – Automate data generation, training, and evaluation.","📂 LeRobot Dataset Format – Standardized data format for easy integration.","🔄 Open-Loop Evaluation – Visualize predictions vs ground truth.","🎯 Multiple Control Modes – Support for both end-effector and joint control in simulation."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/OpenGalaxea/GalaxeaDP/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"b0dad878b3d467dc8b81093216119621607a7773565f50c647edd2532c6d12c9","extractedAt":"2026-10-09T16:44:16.229Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T13:01:17.490Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"GalaxeaDP is the